[gd_scene format=3]

; MeshInstance2D lit by a DirectionalLight2D, through a CanvasTexture normal map. The two QuadMeshes have a
; normal that runs along x and along y, and the Sprite2D beside them has the same texture as the second: the
; mesh reads the map at its own UV, which runs the other way down the quad than the sprite's. No other scene
; lights a mesh with a normal map.

